# Open Claw — tracked tool manifest (the self-aware registry).
# Format: id|source[|cadence]   ·   source ∈ brew apt cargo pipx gem npm eget:<repo> go:<pkg> curl:<url> manual
# cadence ∈ daily weekly biweekly monthly — opts the row into tool-updater.sh's
# background fast lane (rows without a cadence are never auto-updated there).
# `claw pkg track` appends newly-installed tools here; `claw provision` installs them all.

